 "venue": "DiveBar",
 "source": "Docs/specs/venue-dive-bar.md v1.1 4.1-4.7 (state Open), 4.6 + ui-ux 6.5 (Lights-Up, AfterHours). V frame metres. rot = UE rotator [pitch, yaw, roll] deg; rect / spot lights emit along their local +X, a rect's size is [width along local Y, height along local Z]. Photometry: flux_lm (point / rect / spot in lumens) with the DERIVED values of 4.2 / 4.3 (rect flux = pi L A for a luminance L; neon proxy flux = tube flux / pi). states = intensity factor per lighting state (ramped >= 0.8 s by ARbVenueInfo). vol = volumetric scattering intensity; vol_shadow = bCastVolumetricShadow (VDB-T11: every light with vol > 0 casts volumetric shadows; outside / enclosed lights 0). shadows = cast shadows on [High, Epic, Cinematic] (the level stores High). Colours (color, color_tint, neon_gases) are LINEAR RGB; flux_lm is photometric: UE scales a light's lumens by its linear colour without normalising it, so the level stores a coloured light at flux / Y(colour) with the max channel 1 (rb_make_divebar.light_photometry; neon proxies take the flux-weighted mix of their gases). Owner: M2-A.",
 "ramp_seconds": 0.8,
